Package: xdg-desktop-portal-lingmo
Architecture: any
Depends:
  ${shlibs:Depends},
  ${misc:Depends}
Description: Dtk poortal backend for xdg-desktop-portal
  xdg-desktop-portal-lingmo provide a DTK implementation for the
  desktop-agnostic xdg-desktop-portal service. This allows sandboxed
  applications to request services from outside the sandbox using
  Dtk GUIs (app chooser, file chooser, print dialog) or using GNOME
  services (session manager, screenshot provider).
